# Copy to .env only for local overrides. .env is gitignored — per-machine config, not shared
# project content.
#
# Team-specific settings (Jenkins base URL, env/* preview links, skills hub repo) live in the
# gitignored userPreferences.json instead — asked on first start, editable in Settings.
# A VITE_JENKINS_BASE_URL left here from older versions is only used to prefill that prompt.
